      "writtenOn": "2022-11-14T21:44:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems like it would never occur for battery service since `OnDeviceDisconnected` is actually `OnAclDisconnected` and that won\u0027t occur until Battery disconnects.\n\nDoes this work if you remove the code in `DisconnectAllEnabledProfiles`? I would guess no. May want to add a comment to that regard like:\n```\n// For battery service, use this to clean up internal handles. GATT connection\n// is already dropped if ACL disconnect has occurred.\n```",
      "revId": "a9bf8d668bebdb6797ce1190528fec583addf2d8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
