      "writtenOn": "2022-11-14T22:54:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are correct.\n\n1. Just drop this section entirely in favor of always tearing down everything in `BatteryService` whenever `DisconnectAllEnabledProfiles` is called, or\n2. Split disconnecting GATT (`DisconnectAllEnabledProfiles`) from cleaning up (`OnAclDisconnected`)\n\n(2) is probably the most \"correct\" but I doubt it really makes any difference other than that we probably don\u0027t want to be delaying the completion of a disconnect for reasons not related to releasing the GATT connection. Lacking a preference for (1) I will do (2).",
